WEBVTT

1
00:00.300 --> 00:02.200
[soft chord]

2
00:02.200 --> 00:03.900
<v Narrator>Light arrives slowly, from the edge.</v>

3
00:04.300 --> 00:06.000
<v Narrator>Then it <i>warms</i>,</v>

4
00:06.000 --> 00:07.800
<v Narrator>and turns around one point.</v>

5
00:08.300 --> 00:10.000
<v Narrator>Finally it cools</v>

6
00:10.000 --> 00:11.800
<v Narrator>and settles like a <b>tide</b>.</v>
